<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-UHISPANK'S RIGHTS TRADE BEGINS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-UHISPANK'S RIGHTS TRADE BEGINS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in the rights to take part in Uhispank's share issue began today and will end on May 15, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Uhispank will give every share holder one participation right for every share held. After May 21, for every 20 rights held, the shareholder will recieve one share.</p>
<p>The minimum volume for trading of the rights will be 1,000 securities at 0.01 kroons.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
